[111.529304, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #3\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KNow let me print the final README.md to the terminal:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_read([type: text, 135 lines, 3257 chars]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #4\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KPerfect! The README I created applies all the cognitive-doc-design principles:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mHow the principles were applied:\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1m1. Lead with the answer\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 Opens with what it does in 8 words, then shows the output immediately\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 No backstory or motivations before the value prop\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1m2. Progressive disclosure\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[KQuick start (3 commands) \u2192 Common tasks (table) \u2192 Full options \u2192 Advanced examples\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 Reader can stop at any layer when they have enough\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K**3. Chunking &\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u00